    ],
    "desired_behavior": "When a question requires resolving an intermediate entity or comparing multiple items, the Actor should issue a follow-up search query for the unresolved entity or missing fact rather than stopping after one retrieval. It should decompose multi-hop questions into sequential sub-queries and only produce a final answer when it has retrieved evidence for each required sub-fact.",
    "success_criteria": [
      "For bridge-type questions (entity → fact), the Actor retrieves the intermediate entity in query 1, then issues a second query for the missing fact about that entity, achieving ≥2 tool calls per rollout on multi-hop examples.",
